      "mergeID": "616dc19e9dd11b3a0cbe64e9",
      "mergedPostDetails": "In live you will have two ways to write / send an invite message. If you reply to an invite request you can do that in the Quick Menu, and if you invite someone through the Social Page in the Main Menu you will be able to also write the invite message in the Main Menu.\nIn the current open beta you will only be able to use the QM which makes sense for inviting someone though the new Friends Wing and also to reply to invite requests but not for inviting someone through the Main Menu. If you want to invite like 4 people through the Social Page you would have to constantly switch between the Main Menu and the QM, which is really annoying.\nMy suggestion would be to still use the QM for replying and inviting through the Friends Wing, but add the Invite message back to the Main Menu when you are using it to invite someone, just so you don't always have to switch between the MM and the QM.\nI also made a Video that shows what I mean:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qKjOqro_2DM",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1140] Bring back Main Menu Invite messages",
